[thin] These seven 3.000 mm readings measure the bed-rooted fore guide between Y2 and Y5, including its exposed tie ends. Exact CAD supplies 3 mm normal stock at each anchor. The guide supports the front capture lip and defines the outside of the moving leg's corridor; the 0.25 mm lateral air is outside the solid.
alternatives: Thickening inward reduces the running clearance. Thickening outward to 4 mm adds stock below the fore reveal without changing the fit. Translating the guide and moving leg to preserve the gap changes the compact mechanism's placement.
